  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conversion of the PU foam manufacturing sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC Phase-Out Management Plan (Stage 1, Conversion to Cyclopentane in the Manufacture of Panels at Alternativa, and Conversion to Methyl Formate and non-HCFC refrigerants in 6 manufacturers of commercial refrigeration equipment)  The Country#s targeting policy for HCFCs consumption phase-out is based on the following National plan for HPMP implementation, divided in two phases /stages: Stage 1: # Freeze the consumption of HCFCs at the Starting Point level baseline level: 2013 # 75% reduction: by 2020 Stage 2: -  92 % reduction:  by 2025 -  97.5 % reduction:  by 2030 - 100 % phase-out: by 2035</narrative>
  </description>
